sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Browser
  participant CF as CloudFront
  participant MW as Next.js middleware
  participant API as API route
  participant COG as Cognito (JWKS)
  U->>CF: /api/* with Bearer ID token
  CF->>MW: forward request
  MW->>COG: verify token (signature / iss / aud, cached JWKS)
  alt token valid
    MW->>API: allow (next)
    API-->>U: 200 + data
  else missing / invalid
    MW-->>U: 401 → redirect to /login
  end
